      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2 : Overview of Real-IISR. The Thermal-Structural Guidance (TSG) module fuses thermal priors for degradation-aware encoding. The VAR backbone performs scale-by-scale generation via next-scale prediction, while the Condition-Adaptive Codebook (CAC) dynamically adjusts quantized embeddings based on degradation-aware priors for thermal fidelity. Finally, the Thermal Order Consistency Loss ℒ TOC \\mathcal{L}_{\\text{TOC}} preserves physically consistent thermal ordering.",
      "image_url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2603.04745v1/Pipeline.png",
