      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. Overview of FUSAR-GPT. The framework adopts a two-stage training strategy: Stage-1 jointly updates LoRA and the TLM- MLP for multimodal prior injection, while Stage-2 fine-tunes only LoRA for task adaptation. The TLM module fuses SAR visual tokens with AEF priors by generating spatially informed modulation parameters, which are applied to the visual tokens to enhance downstream reasoning.",
