      "figure": "Figure 3",
      "caption": "Figure 3. InfinityHuman Pipeline. The pipeline generates high-resolution (HR) audio-driven full-body videos through a two-stage coarse- to-fine process. First, a speech-aligned low-resolution (LR) video is generated using multimodal conditioning (text and audio) and DiT blocks. In the second stage, a pose-guided refiner utilizes pose guidance, LR latents, and reference images to restore degraded details, enhancing identity consistency, motion coherence, and hand realism.",
