      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. Architecture of the proposed LiteSense framework. The model takes an RGB image, ToF distance and CNH measurements as inputs. Each modality is encoded separately, fused across multiple scales, and decoded to produce a high-resolution metric depth map. The Spatial Block is implemented using MobileNetV4-based [33] blocks, and PCSI is a module specifically designed to fuse CNH information.",
