      "figure": "Figure 4",
      "caption": "Figure 4 : Overview of HyCal , our training-free prototype calibration method. For each XD-VSCIL task, class prototypes are constructed from frozen CLIP embeddings using a few sample images during training. At inference, HyCal combines cosine similarity and Mahalanobis distance to compute test-to-prototype scores, enabling robust classification under domain shift and data imbalance.",
